{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q1", "domain": "unknown", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的出身情况？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：庚申年、甲申月、己巳日、壬申时。日主己土生于申月，金旺土虚，年柱庚申、时柱壬申均为伤官生财，月干甲木正官透出，但坐申金被克。整体格局为伤官生财，财星壬水透于时干，但财星无强根，且申金为财之长生，但金多水浊，财源虽广却难聚。年柱庚申为伤官，伤官在年，主祖上或早年家境一般，且伤官克官，父亲或长辈可能事业不顺。月柱甲申，正官坐伤官，官星受制，主父母关系或家庭环境有波折。日支巳火为印星，但巳申合水，印星被合，家庭助力有限。综合来看，命主出身并非大富大贵，也非贫穷至极，属于普通家庭，经济上略有盈余但不算宽裕，符合“出身普通，虽不捉襟见肘，可惜盈余不多”的描述。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q1", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4417, "response_id": "77f27cf4-5c59-4464-944f-5d992adbf8fe", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 251, "completion_tokens": 246, "total_tokens": 497, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 123}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
