{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q3", "domain": "career", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的配偶工作状况？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于申月，金旺土虚，日主偏弱。月干甲木正官透出，坐申金被克，官星受损。时柱壬申，正财坐伤官，财星亦被泄。年柱庚申，伤官强旺，伤官克官，婚姻宫（日支）为巳火印星，但被申金合绊，配偶宫受制。\n\n配偶星为甲木正官，但甲木坐申金绝地，且被年、时申金冲克，官星无力，说明配偶事业根基不稳，难有高就。日支巳火为配偶宫，巳申合，配偶易受外界影响，且巳火生己土，但被申金合去，助力有限。整体看，配偶为普通打工者，职级不高，收入平平，对家庭帮助不大。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q3", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4456, "response_id": "88891a44-74c2-4737-b04b-ef3d2d8b52f2", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 265, "completion_tokens": 202, "total_tokens": 467, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 137}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q4", "domain": "unknown", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的子息状况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于申月，金旺土虚，日坐巳火为印星，时柱壬申金水相生。女命以食伤为子女星，此八字中月干甲木为正官，时干壬水为正财，食伤星（金）在年、月、时支中均有申金，但申金为伤官，且被巳火合克，子女星受制明显。同时，日支巳火为印星，印星过旺会克制食伤，不利子息。时柱壬申，壬水为财，申金为伤官，但申金被巳火合，子女宫受制，且申金在时支为晚运，子女缘分较薄。结合大运来看，命主在2004甲申年（24岁）时，流年甲木正官透出，申金伤官伏吟，但此年甲木合日主己土，官星合身，且申金为子女星，但被巳火合克，难以成孕。2010庚寅年（30岁），庚金伤官透出，寅木与巳火相刑，且寅申冲，子女宫动荡，但庚金伤官得禄于申，此年有生育机会，但寅申冲，子女星被冲，可能为子。综合判断，命主子女星受制，但并非完全无子，且时柱壬申，申为伤官，伤官为女命之子星，但被合，故可能只有一子，且出生年份在2010庚寅年（因庚金伤官透出，寅木为官星之根，但寅申冲，子女星动）。因此，最符合的是D选项。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q4", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4893, "response_id": "0546af18-3391-498a-b726-062c324030e9", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 392, "total_tokens": 628, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
